  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thrive Philippines: School Meals Change Lives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Many children in the Philippines suffer from poor diet and inadequate nutrition often leading to undernourishment and negatively impacting mental and physical development. However, with proper nutrition cognitive development is improved and children are more likely to stay in school longer, giving them a chance at a better life (World Bank 2021).   At Thrive our aim is to provide the brain fuel children need to start their day and reach their full potential one healthy meal at a time.</narrative>
  </description>
